  "question": {
    "text": "The distance of the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>–</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> form the line passing through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>–</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and perpendicular to the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></math> is",
